{{!
    @template tool_vae/notes_block

    The block of the annotations of one target: its heading, its lines, and the form for whoever may annotate.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\notes_block. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except these keys:
    * lineshtml - the lines, drawn by the template tool_vae/note_lines
    * formhtml - the form of an annotation, drawn by moodleform::render() ('' for whoever may not annotate)

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading - string, the heading of the block
    * lineshtml - string, the lines
    * formhtml - string, the form or ''

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "Annotations",
        "lineshtml": "<p class=\"small text-muted\">An annotation validates nothing.</p>",
        "formhtml": "<form action=\"#\"></form>"
    }
}}
<section class="tool-vae-notes mt-4"><h3 class="h5">{{heading}}</h3>{{{lineshtml}}}{{{formhtml}}}</section>
